{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42962","headline":"凤栖怨 · 颜舒","name":"凤栖怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳人名莫愁，珠箔上花钩。\n清镜鸳鸯匣，新妆翡翠楼。\n捣衣明月夜，吹管白云秋。\n惟恨金吾子，年年向陇头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}